  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome back agent 27. We need you to carry oit another mission for us.
    \nThis gun in your hand is a failed experiment, shooting it causes it overheat,
    and after a your bullets will melt to molten steam, Shooting it even more causes
    it to evaporate to high pressure toxic gas. And if you manage to take it to its
    limits... Who knows what you'll see.\n\nYour mission is to eliminate the radioactive
    creatures that emerged after a factory failure, each one is weak to a certain
    bullet type.\n\nYellow enemies are weak to solid\nOrange enemies are weak to
    liquid\nGreen enemies are weak to gas\n\nAnd when will we extract you? Lets just
    say were working on that :333 ~...\n-Some capitalist factory owner"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
